OL,3,GNEWSAFamily upset as man 'spits' on
OL,4,Amurdered MP's statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of Sir David Amess have told
OL,7,Fof their upset after a TikToker
OL,8,Fuploaded a video of him appearing to
OL,9,Fspit on the statue of the murdered MP.
OL,11,FEssex Police said it had received a
OL,12,Freport about the incident on Wednesday.
OL,13,FThe video has since been taken down.
OL,15,FA spokesman for the Amess family said:
OL,16,F"To see his memorial treated in this
OL,17,Fway is deeply upsetting."
OL,19,FThe Conservative MP for Southend West
OL,20,Fwas stabbed multiple times while
OL,21,Fholding a constituency surgery in
OL,22,FLeigh-on-Sea, Essex, in October 2021.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
